stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: Student submits
    Pending --> Assigned: Admin assigns staff
    Assigned --> Assigned: Admin reassigns
    Assigned --> InProgress: Staff starts work
    InProgress --> Resolved: Staff resolves (note required)
    Resolved --> Closed: Admin verifies
    Resolved --> Reopened: Student/Admin (reason required)
    Closed --> Reopened: Admin (reason required)
    Reopened --> Assigned: Admin reassigns
    Reopened --> InProgress: Staff resumes
